us":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m004-0102","start":102,"end":103,"surface":"段","kind":"person","person_id":"dlo_vgs_o6c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m004-0110","start":110,"end":111,"surface":"段","kind":"person","person_id":"dlo_vgs_o6c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m004-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m004-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"武姜","kind":"person","person_id":"06i_k5v_922_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m004-0153","start":153,"end":158,"surface":"潁谷之考叔","kind":"person","person_id":"4qd_4bt_jf6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m004-0167","start":167,"end":169,"surface":"考叔","kind":"person","person_id":"4qd_4bt_jf6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m004-0172","start":172,"end":175,"surface":"臣有母","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或指代待核；不補姓名、成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m004-0180","start":180,"end":182,"surface":"臣母","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、泛稱或指代待核；不補姓名、成員或親屬關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m004-0184","start":184,"end":186,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"muq_yy8_8er","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m004-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"考叔","kind":"person","person_id":"4qd_4bt_jf6","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-042-zheng","book_id":"b-shiji-042","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-042-zheng"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p023","text":"伏自尋省，廢昏立明，事非為己。廬陵之事，不由傍人，內積蕭牆之釁，外行叔段之罰，既制之有主，臣何預焉。然廬陵為性輕險，悌順不足，武皇臨崩，亦有口詔，比雖發自營陽，實非國禍。至於羨之、亮等，周旋同體，心腹內外，政欲戮力皇家，盡忠報主。若令臣等頗欲執權，不專為國，初廢營陽，陛下在遠，武皇之子，尚有童幼，擁以號令，誰敢非之。而泝流三千，虛館三月，奉迎鑾駕，以遵下武，血心若斯，易為可鑒。且臣等奉事先朝，十有七年，並居顯耍，世稱恭謹，不圖一旦致茲釁罰。夫周公大賢，尚有流言之謗，伯奇至孝，不免譖愬之禍。慈父非無情於仁子，明君豈有志於貞臣。姦遘所移，勢回山岳，況乃精誠微淺，而望求信者哉。詩不云乎：「讒人罔極，交亂四國。愷悌君子，無信讒言。」陛下躬覽篇籍，研覈是非，釁兆之萌，宜應深察。臣竊懼王室小有皇甫之患，大有閻樂之禍，夙夜殷憂，若無首領。夫周道浸微，桓、文稱伐，君側亂國，趙鞅入誅。況今凶禍滔天，辰極危逼，台輔孥戮，岳牧傾陷。臣才非絳侯，安漢是職，人愧博陸，廁奉遺旨。國難既深，家痛亦切。輒簡徒繕甲，軍次巴陵，蕭欣窘懾，望風奔迸。臣誠短劣，在國忘身，仰憑社稷之靈，俯厲義勇之氣，將長驅電掃，直入石頭，梟翦元凶，誅夷首惡，弔二公之寃魂，寫私門之禍痛。然後分歸司寇，甘赴鼎鑊，雖死之日，猶生之年。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p023:m0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"叔段","person_id":"dlo_vgs_o6c","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"引鄭莊公與弟段典故。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p023:m0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"羨之","person_id":"4y6_myv_ojh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p023:m0090","start":90,"end":91,"surface":"亮","person_id":"2dj_m53_6zg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p023:u0142","start":142,"end":143,"surface":"子","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"泛指武皇的年幼諸子。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p023:m0235","start":235,"end":237,"surface":"伯奇","person_id":"umo_75h_6xk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p023:m0345","start":345,"end":347,"surface":"皇甫","person_id":"pj5_nx0_lyq","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p023:m0352","start":352,"end":354,"surface":"閻樂","person_id":"rqi_av3_iy9","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p023:m0384","start":384,"end":386,"surface":"趙鞅","person_id":"jg7_dpd_2ev","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本句具名用字及語境聯繫現役人物。"},{"id":"c-songshu-044-xiehui-digital:p023:m0453","st